# Merge drivers that keep parallel agent work conflict-free.
#
# +team/+coordination/ files are append-only shared artifacts (daily logs,
# impediments-log): several personas append rows at the same time, which
# would conflict on line adjacency in every integration merge. The union
# driver keeps both sides' added lines instead. Entries there MUST stay
# append-only - add rows, never edit or reorder another persona's rows
# (convention: +wit/common/conventions/coordination.md).
+team/+coordination/*.md merge=union
